# Terraform
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored — it must be committed.
# NOTE: env tfvars (dev.tfvars, prod.tfvars) are intentionally NOT ignored — they hold
#       non-secret values only. Anything sensitive goes in Secrets Manager, never a tfvars.

# Anything explicitly marked secret
*.tfvars.secret

# Cluster / cloud credentials
kubeconfig*
*.kubeconfig
.kube/
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*

# Private working notes — must never be published (holds the course->file mapping)
NOTES.md

# Tool caches
.task/
.terraform.lock.hcl.bak

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
